translate es strings:

    # ── Narration ──

    old "You're sleeping soundly when a warm, wet sensation begins to pull you from your dreams."
    new "Estas durmiendo profundamente cuando una sensacion calida y humeda comienza a sacarte de tus suenos."

    old "Something feels... really good. Your mind swims between sleep and consciousness."
    new "Algo se siente... muy bien. Tu mente flota entre el sueno y la consciencia."

    old "A wave of pleasure washes over you, slowly dragging you out of sleep."
    new "Una ola de placer te invade, arrastrándote lentamente fuera del sueno."

    # ── Greeting: cum_lover ──

    old "Mmm... good morning~ I couldn't help myself."
    new "Mmm... buenos dias~ No pude evitarlo."

    old "I woke up and just... wanted a taste."
    new "Me desperte y solo... queria probar."

    # ── Greeting: hardcore ──

    old "Don't mind me. Just having my breakfast."
    new "No me hagas caso. Solo estoy desayunando."

    old "Shh. Relax. I know what I'm doing."
    new "Shh. Relajate. Se lo que hago."

    # ── Greeting: cute ──

    old "Oh! You're awake... I, um... I wanted to surprise you."
    new "Oh! Estas despierto... Yo, eh... queria sorprenderte."

    old "I... I thought you might like waking up to this..."
    new "Yo... pense que te gustaria despertar asi..."

    # ── Greeting: default ──

    old "Good morning~ Thought I'd give you a nice start to the day."
    new "Buenos dias~ Pense en darte un buen comienzo de dia."

    old "Rise and shine. I'm making sure you wake up in a good mood."
    new "Arriba y brilla. Me aseguro de que despiertes de buen humor."

    # ── Greeting: favorite ──

    old "You know this is my favorite, right? Lucky you~"
    new "Sabes que esto es mi favorito, verdad? Que suerte la tuya~"

    old "I could do this all morning..."
    new "Podria hacer esto toda la manana..."

    # ── Witness ──

    old "Wha... what are you doing?!"
    new "Que... que estas haciendo?!"

    old "Oh my god... already?! It's morning!"
    new "Dios mio... ya?! Es de manana!"

    old "I... I didn't expect to see THIS when I woke up."
    new "Yo... no esperaba ver ESTO al despertar."

    # ── After BJ ──

    old "Mmm... now THAT'S a good morning."
    new "Mmm... ESO si es un buen dia."

    old "Hope that was a nice wake-up call~"
    new "Espero que haya sido un buen despertar~"

    old "You're welcome, by the way."
    new "De nada, por cierto."

    # ── After wake ──

    old "Now let's get ready for the day, shall we?"
    new "Ahora vamos a prepararnos para el dia, si?"

    old "Come on, we should get moving."
    new "Vamos, tenemos que movernos."

    # ── After duo wake ──

    old "Well... that was something to wake up to."
    new "Bueno... eso fue una forma de despertar."

    old "I think we're all awake now..."
    new "Creo que ya estamos todas despiertas..."

    # ── Menu ──

    old "Continue where we left off."
    new "Continuar donde lo dejamos."

    old "Good morning to you too."
    new "Buenos dias a ti tambien."

    old "Good morning, you two."
    new "Buenos dias a las dos."
