translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Morning. Hands off. I'll tell you when you can move."
    new "Buenos días. Las manos quietas. Yo te digo cuándo puedes moverte."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Don't move. This is my breakfast, and I say how it goes."
    new "No te muevas. Este es mi desayuno, y yo digo cómo va."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Mmm... morning. I want it all the way down my throat."
    new "Mmm... buenos días. La quiero toda hasta el fondo de mi garganta."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "You wake up to warmth and weight settling over your face, her thighs pinning your head to the pillow."
    new "Despiertas con un calor y un peso acomodándose sobre tu cara, sus muslos aprisionando tu cabeza contra la almohada."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Something soft presses down on your mouth. You open your eyes to find her straddling your face, looking down at you."
    new "Algo suave presiona tu boca. Abres los ojos y la encuentras montada sobre tu cara, mirándote desde arriba."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "A hand grips your hair and the world goes dark and warm. By the time you're awake, she's already sitting on your face."
    new "Una mano te agarra del pelo y el mundo se vuelve oscuro y cálido. Para cuando despiertas, ella ya está sentada en tu cara."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Morning. Tongue out. You're not getting up until I'm done."
    new "Buenos días. Saca la lengua. No te levantas hasta que yo termine."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Don't bother saying good morning. Your mouth has a job to do."
    new "No te molestes en decir buenos días. Tu boca tiene un trabajo que hacer."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Awake? Good. Get to work, and don't stop until I tell you to."
    new "¿Despierto? Bien. A trabajar, y no pares hasta que yo te diga."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Good boy. Now you can say good morning."
    new "Buen chico. Ahora sí puedes decir buenos días."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "That's how I like to start my day. Remember it."
    new "Así me gusta empezar el día. Recuérdalo."

    # game/scripts/Events/morning_bj.rpy:55
    old "Mmm. You may get up now."
    new "Mmm. Ya puedes levantarte."

